  "quotes": [
    {
      "block": "原句1",
      "no": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "We're fully, permanently mated, Ophelia. I agreed to that while I was starving, and before the mate bond was reality. I ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1211
        }
      ],
      "words": 31
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I had my people pack your house and move everything here. I warned them about the pottery, and nothing broke",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1580
        }
      ],
      "words": 20
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "This thing between us isn't going anywhere. It isn't what you wanted, but it's what you have. I am what you have",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2004
        }
      ],
      "words": 22
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I fucking love the taste of your blood, and you're right about you deserving to eat as well as I do. I eat like a king; ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2440
        }
      ],
      "words": 39
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Asking someone else for money is as good as cheating in my book. You're lucky I'm letting you live away from me at all",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3671
        }
      ],
      "words": 24
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "It was so peaceful, it made my chest burn. My anger was completely and utterly absent, now",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6213
        }
      ],
      "words": 17
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"You could fly any time you want, around here,\" Dante said. \"I can't fly.\"",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6305
        }
      ],
      "words": 14
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "when angels do arranged marriages, they usually don't stay in contact afterward. I never even met my mom. That's basical",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8844
        }
      ],
      "words": 23
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"We're not a fucking couple,\" I said bluntly. \"We are a fucking couple. Good luck with your prison map.\"",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10087
        }
      ],
      "words": 19
    },
    {
      "block": "原句10",
      "no": 10,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"Then the food was good, but you taste fucking divine\"",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 11897
        }
      ],
      "words": 10
    },
    {
      "block": "原句11",
      "no": 11,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"Dark doesn't equal bad, and light doesn't equal good",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 11660
        },
        {
          "text": "I think your family situation proved that\"",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 11711
        }
      ],
      "words": 16
    }
